    dct:type "resolution-route/empirical-data" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.75"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "Existing observations can constrain particular network models but cannot identify the claimed microscopic ontology. Resolution needs a specified dynamics and data sensitive to its distinctive small-scale effects." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Derive distinctive low-energy or propagation signatures from a trivalent network model and compare them with precision particle, gravitational, and astrophysical observations. Network-specific deviations would support it; observations incompatible with every such network realization would refute it." ;
